{"seq":13,"slug":"ecommerce-user-growth","title":"电商用户增长","stage":"DONE","category":"ecommerce","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-user-growth","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.39,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 电商用户增长 简介\n\n用户增长是电商业务的生命线。在获客成本持续攀升、用户注意力日益碎片化的竞争环境中，如何科学地获取新用户、有效地留住老用户、并最大化每位用户的生命周期价值，已成为电商企业最核心的经营命题。\n\n本知识库从增长理论到实战策略，系统构建电商用户增长的完整知识体系，面向增长产品经理、用户运营人员和电商业务负责人。\n\n第1章**增长基础**建立用户增长的理论框架，介绍主流增长模型、指标体系设计和增长团队的组织搭建，为后续实践打下方法论基础。\n\n第2章**用户获取**深入探讨获客阶段的核心策略，涵盖付费获客渠道的选择与优化、自然增长的长期策略以及裂变与病毒式增长的设计方法。\n\n第3章**留存与活跃**聚焦用户生命周期中最关键的留存环节，讲解留存分析方法、活跃度提升策略和流失预警与挽回机制的系统化建设。\n\n第4章**变现与LTV**从商业回报的角度审视用户增长，探讨变现模式设计、用户生命周期价值的优化策略以及单位经济学在增长决策中的应用。\n\n建议读者从第1章的增长模型开始系统学习，理解增长的全局框架后，再结合业务阶段重点攻克获客、留存或变现方向。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"growth-fundamentals","title":"增长基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-user-growth/growth-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"growth-model-overview","title":"增长模型概述","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-user-growth/growth-fundamentals/growth-model-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"growth-metrics-framework","title":"增长指标体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-user-growth/growth-fundamentals/growth-metrics-framework"},{"seq":3,"slug":"growth-team-building","title":"增长团队搭建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-user-growth/growth-fundamentals/growth-team-building"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"acquisition","title":"用户获取","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-user-growth/acquisition","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"paid-acquisition-channels","title":"付费获客渠道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-user-growth/acquisition/paid-acquisition-channels"},{"seq":2,"slug":"organic-growth-strategy","title":"自然增长策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-user-growth/acquisition/organic-growth-strategy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"referral-viral-growth","title":"裂变与病毒增长","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-user-growth/acquisition/referral-viral-growth"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"retention-engagement","title":"留存与活跃","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-user-growth/retention-engagement","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"retention-analysis","title":"留存分析方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-user-growth/retention-engagement/retention-analysis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"engagement-strategy","title":"用户活跃与参与度策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-user-growth/retention-engagement/engagement-strategy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"churn-prediction-prevention","title":"流失预测与防流失策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-user-growth/retention-engagement/churn-prediction-prevention"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"monetization-ltv","title":"变现与LTV","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-user-growth/monetization-ltv","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"monetization-models","title":"电商变现模式与盈利架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-user-growth/monetization-ltv/monetization-models"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ltv-optimization","title":"LTV 优化与用户价值管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-user-growth/monetization-ltv/ltv-optimization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"unit-economics-growth","title":"单位经济模型与增长可持续性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-user-growth/monetization-ltv/unit-economics-growth"}]}]}